+# Matches the ``<major>.<minor>`` in a flink-dist jar name, tolerating an optional
+# Scala suffix and vendor qualifiers, e.g.::
+#     flink-dist-2.1.3.jar                            -> 2.1
+#     flink-dist-1.20.1.jar                           -> 1.20
